        "title": "Additive Manufacturing: FDM, SLA, DMLS",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Additive manufacturing (AM) builds parts layer-by-layer from digital models. Process choice determines material class, resolution, anisotropy, porosity, cost, and lead time. The same CAD file can yield parts with vastly different properties depending on process."
    },
